msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_PeopleAndMonAreSame"
msgid ""
"People and POKéMON, they are but\n"
"the same…\p"
"Their individual nature makes them\n"
"good at certain things, and not good\l"
"at others.$"
